v class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The test equipment has adapators\nfor connection to various types of injection systems; before making\nthe connections, fit the appropriate adpators to the equipment.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>2. Open the cock.</p><p>3. Close the cock.</p><p>4. Close the cock.</p><p>5. Position the test equipment and connect it to the fuel manifold&#x27;s\nbleed valve by means of the specific connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Rapid connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.684.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046030.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,1,0,"<p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ninjectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>N70D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Start the engine and check that the pressure\ngauge&#x27;s reading is within the specified limits.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Check delivery pressure (bar)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Switch off the engine.</p><p>Operate the fuel pump by means of the &#x27;Active\nDiagnosis&#x27; of the diagnostic equipment and check that the pressure\ndoes not exceed 4 bar.</p><p>Disconnect the test equipment and specific\nconnector from the fuel manifold bleed valve.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rapid connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.684.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Pressure gauge</p></td><td 